WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:15.640
<i>Long before our time,</i>


00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:18.393
<i>the heavenly Zenithians
gathered their strength</i>


00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.896
<i>to seal the evil Nimzo
behind the gates to Nadiria,</i>


00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:26.776
<i>but their victory came at the cost
of a catastrophic loss of life.</i>


00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:33.575
<i>Should a villain emerge and succeed
in opening these gates to the dark world,</i>


00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:39.039
<i>the only way to shut them tight once more
is with a sword imbued with holy power.</i>


00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:47.047
<i>That sword must be wielded
by a heavenly hero</i>


00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:50.508
<i>descended from the Zenithian bloodline.</i>


00:00:56.514 --> 00:00:59.642
SANCHO: SIRE! KING PANKRAZ! IT'S A BABY!
A BEAUTIFUL LITTLE BABY!


00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:02.395
PANKRAZ: OH, MY! BLESS THE GODDESS!


00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:05.315
PANKRAZ: YOU SHALL BE KNOWN AS LUCA.


00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:07.150
MADA: OH, PANKRAZ! YOU REALLY ARE...


00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:09.069
GUGH!


00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:11.613
PANKRAZ: GOODNESS! WHAT IS IT?
ARE YOU ALRIGHT, MY DEAR?


00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.787
<i>NOT LONG AFTER GIVING BIRTH,</i>


00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:21.206
<i>LUCA'S MOTHER, MADA,
WAS ABDUCTED BY MONSTERS.</i>


00:01:22.707 --> 00:01:27.087
*: I HEAR THAT YOU AND YOUR FATHER
ARE TRAVELING AROUND TOGETHER.


00:01:27.504 --> 00:01:31.174
RODRIGO: AH, PANKRAZ!
I'LL BE IN TOUCH ONCE I FIND THE SWORD.


00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.134
NERA, COME HERE TO PAPA.


00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:37.388
<i>NERA BLUSHES BRIGHTLY UPON SEEING LUCA.</i>


00:01:37.972 --> 00:01:42.185
BIANCA: I'M BIANCA. DO YOU REMEMBER ME?


00:01:42.727 --> 00:01:44.020
*: GO ON! PURR AGAIN, PUSS!


00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:46.064
BIANCA: LEAVE HIM ALONE! GIVE HIM TO ME!


00:01:46.147 --> 00:01:47.524
*: THEN YOU CAN HAVE HIM


00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:49.776
AFTER YOU DEFEAT THE GHOSTS
AT UPTATEN TOWERS!


00:01:50.193 --> 00:01:51.361
<i>BIANCA ATTACKS! 18 POINTS!</i>


00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.654
<i>HAUNTED HOUSEKEEPER ATTACKS!</i>


00:01:52.737 --> 00:01:55.365
<i>LUCA ATTACKS! DOES 21 DAMAGE!</i>


00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:57.158
<i>THE HAUNTED HOUSEKEEPER IS DEFEATED!</i>


00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.662
BIANCA: OH! WHAT'S THAT?
WHAT A PRETTY BALL!


00:02:00.745 --> 00:02:03.289
I'LL BET IT'S SOME KIND OF REWARD.
WE SHOULD TAKE IT WITH US.


00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:07.001
<i>LUCA ACQUIRES THE DRAGON ORB!</i>


00:02:07.377 --> 00:02:12.423
*: FINE. TAKE THE STUPID CAT!


00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.218
BIANCA: YAY!
THAT'S GOOD NEWS, ISN'T IT, CAT?


00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.636
NO MORE BULLYING FOR YOU!


00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:21.224
BIANCA: WE SHOULD GIVE THE PUSS A NAME!


00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:26.479
HMM... WHAT DO YOU THINK
ABOUT CALLING IT PURRCY?


00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:34.404
<i>PANKRAZ AND LUCA
CONTINUE ON THEIR QUEST TO FIND MADA.</i>


00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:40.451
Is that all you've got, Luca?


00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:42.203
Far from it!


00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:51.087
Hey, Purrcy! Wait up!


00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:53.840
Wait for me!


00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:59.387
The boy is growing up so fast.


00:03:00.805 --> 00:03:02.390
Is something the matter, Sancho?


00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:06.603
No, Your Majesty, I just wish Lady Mada
could see her son is all.


00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:09.230
Indeed.


00:03:09.314 --> 00:03:11.608
<i>-Come back here!
-So do I, Sancho.</i>


00:03:12.775 --> 00:03:13.902
I've got you now!


00:03:14.652 --> 00:03:16.321
Ouch...


00:03:16.404 --> 00:03:19.073
Purrcy? Where are you?


00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:20.325
Hey, you there.


00:03:20.825 --> 00:03:23.369
Sorry, didn't mean to scare you.


00:03:25.496 --> 00:03:30.210
Say, that's a great orb you've got.
May I have a look?


00:03:30.627 --> 00:03:33.171
Luca, we're leaving soon.


00:03:33.254 --> 00:03:34.547
Coming!


00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:52.440
My dad's the strongest in the world.


00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:02.575
You're getting better, Luca.
Makes me proud to be your father.


00:04:04.285 --> 00:04:08.581
Why is this time of year so depressing?


00:04:11.334 --> 00:04:13.086
What business have you in Coburg?


00:04:16.047 --> 00:04:19.341
Do not be alarmed. My name is Pankraz.


00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:21.052
I'm here at His Majesty's request.


00:04:22.553 --> 00:04:24.138
Right you are!


00:04:27.392 --> 00:04:32.313
Prince Harry!
You must return to Lord Pankraz!


00:04:32.397 --> 00:04:34.399
No. He's a big old bossy boots.


00:04:34.482 --> 00:04:36.317
But it's dangerous outside the grounds.


00:04:36.401 --> 00:04:39.153
Pipe down, Frank, or you'll be sharing
your shirt with a frog again!


00:04:41.239 --> 00:04:42.532
Hey!


00:04:43.366 --> 00:04:44.575
Who might you be?


00:04:44.659 --> 00:04:47.704
Oh, I remember now. You're Pankraz's boy.


00:04:47.787 --> 00:04:50.123
Did he tell you to come and nanny me?


00:04:50.206 --> 00:04:52.583
Kind of. You must be Harry.


00:04:52.667 --> 00:04:57.338
<i>You shall call me Prince Harry.
I'm second most powerful after the king.</i>


00:04:57.422 --> 00:04:58.381
Really?


00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:00.967
Well, my dad's the strongest in the world.


00:05:01.384 --> 00:05:02.760
You don't say.


00:05:04.595 --> 00:05:07.181
In that case, you can be my lackey.


00:05:07.765 --> 00:05:09.559
Race to the castle.


00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:11.436
-Three, two, one... Go!
-Hey!


00:05:12.937 --> 00:05:14.230
That's not fair!


00:05:16.107 --> 00:05:17.108
Watch out!


00:05:21.904 --> 00:05:23.573
-Let go of me!
-Stop!


00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.200
How dare you! Release me!


00:05:27.827 --> 00:05:30.330
Dad!


00:05:34.917 --> 00:05:36.794
-Let's go.
-Wow!


00:05:37.253 --> 00:05:38.713
He really is strong.


00:05:43.634 --> 00:05:45.845
Impressive.


00:05:46.846 --> 00:05:49.932
You gave both Kon
and Slon a sound beating.


00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:51.392
Ladja!


00:05:51.768 --> 00:05:54.937
You really should keep
a closer eye on those boys.


00:06:06.574 --> 00:06:10.161
Now, give me a show to remember!


00:06:14.248 --> 00:06:16.751
It's payback time.


00:06:16.834 --> 00:06:18.252
You're dead meat.


00:06:21.798 --> 00:06:22.632
Luca!


00:06:23.383 --> 00:06:24.884
Get up, Luca!


00:06:27.095 --> 00:06:28.846
No!


00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.390
Luca, listen to me!


00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:41.692
Dad!


00:06:45.613 --> 00:06:49.409
A father's love for his son
is a precious thing indeed.


00:06:49.909 --> 00:06:53.204
But nothing lasts forever.


00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.376
Dad...


00:06:59.293 --> 00:07:00.169
Luca...


00:07:01.212 --> 00:07:02.296
you must...


00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:09.387
Dad...


00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.932
Dad!


00:07:13.599 --> 00:07:15.476
Oh, how your screams delight me.


00:07:15.977 --> 00:07:19.313
Let me hear some more!


00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:23.317
Dad!


00:07:23.401 --> 00:07:24.402
Luca...


00:07:26.237 --> 00:07:27.905
your mother...


00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:31.242
is still alive.


00:07:32.785 --> 00:07:33.995
Please...


00:07:35.204 --> 00:07:36.205
your mother...


00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:43.045
Dad!


00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:45.465
How touching.


00:07:47.467 --> 00:07:50.386
Dad!


00:07:50.761 --> 00:07:51.971
Let me go!


00:07:53.556 --> 00:07:57.059
No. You will live happily ever after
as my slave instead.


00:08:07.862 --> 00:08:09.071
Are you alright, Luca?


00:08:10.364 --> 00:08:12.033
Did you have another nightmare?


00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:15.578
Don't worry, Harry. I'm fine.


00:08:16.662 --> 00:08:18.164
I thought I told you already.


00:08:18.581 --> 00:08:22.710
<i>You are to call me Prince Harry, lackey.</i>


00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:27.965
Are you still going on about that?
We're both slaves here, remember?


00:08:28.049 --> 00:08:30.301
I can't help it, I'm royalty.


00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.553
More to the point...


00:08:33.304 --> 00:08:36.390
We've been stuck here for ten years.
Why haven't we escaped?


00:08:36.474 --> 00:08:40.102
Because it's far too dangerous.
How many times have we been over this?


00:08:45.066 --> 00:08:47.401
Hey! Why are you slowing down?


00:08:48.027 --> 00:08:49.195
Useless idiot!


00:08:55.326 --> 00:08:56.911
Hey, you.


00:08:58.621 --> 00:09:01.666
You guys want out of here?


00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.961
Do you know a way?


00:09:05.044 --> 00:09:06.128
Oh, yeah.


00:09:06.212 --> 00:09:09.715
I know plenty of slaves
who escaped here in barrels.


00:09:10.883 --> 00:09:12.885
They were all dead. Dead!


00:09:13.469 --> 00:09:15.012
If you can't hack it here,


00:09:15.096 --> 00:09:17.765
they stuff you in a barrel
and dump you in the river.


00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:20.810
That's it!


00:09:20.893 --> 00:09:21.727
Seriously?


00:09:36.617 --> 00:09:38.286
Are you sure about this?


00:09:38.661 --> 00:09:39.912
Dead sure.


00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:42.081
I'll go it alone if I have to.


00:09:43.207 --> 00:09:45.084
When you put it like that...


00:09:48.421 --> 00:09:49.422
Ugh!


00:09:49.505 --> 00:09:53.217
-What are you doing? That reeks!
-Quiet. They'll hear us.


00:09:53.301 --> 00:09:54.802
What is this gunk?


00:09:54.885 --> 00:09:57.346
It was floating in there.


00:09:59.849 --> 00:10:00.933
Is that...


00:10:01.642 --> 00:10:02.727
what I think it is?


00:10:04.687 --> 00:10:07.982
If we do this, we have to do it properly.


00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.084
Who put this barrel here?


00:10:27.168 --> 00:10:29.045
It's suspicious, alright.


00:10:37.386 --> 00:10:38.638
Urgh!


00:10:38.721 --> 00:10:40.681
These two stink worse than a pigsty!


00:10:41.098 --> 00:10:42.933
Toss them! Quickly!


00:10:43.017 --> 00:10:44.727
Me?


00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:27.561
We made it.


00:11:28.229 --> 00:11:29.522
We're alive!


00:11:30.106 --> 00:11:32.191
I can't believe it!


00:11:33.067 --> 00:11:34.527
Runaways, are you?


00:12:11.439 --> 00:12:12.898
Thank you.


00:12:13.649 --> 00:12:16.902
-Please come again.
-I'm hammered!


00:12:30.082 --> 00:12:30.916
Hey.


00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:34.253
The coast is clear.


00:12:34.336 --> 00:12:35.421
-Okay.
-Alright.


00:12:37.923 --> 00:12:41.177
Here, drink this. It'll warm you up.


00:12:42.511 --> 00:12:43.804
Thank you.


00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.772
You still stink, by the way.


00:12:53.773 --> 00:12:57.443
Sorry about that. The thing is...


00:12:57.526 --> 00:13:00.196
It's kind of a long story, but...


00:13:00.279 --> 00:13:04.074
My name's Dr. Agon.
Escapees are welcome here.


00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:08.704
I opened this pub here on Mount Azimuth
to spy on that temple.


00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:11.248
Isn't that insanely dangerous?


00:13:11.332 --> 00:13:12.708
It has its risks,


00:13:13.167 --> 00:13:15.961
but if I do nothing,
then disaster will befall us all.


00:13:16.629 --> 00:13:19.215
It seems Bishop Ladja
is planning to open the gates to Nadiria.


00:13:19.757 --> 00:13:22.593
He wants to bring back Grandmaster Nimzo.


00:13:23.135 --> 00:13:24.386
Nimzo?


00:13:25.262 --> 00:13:27.181
He's the ultimate evil,


00:13:27.264 --> 00:13:30.851
capable of plunging this world
into eternal darkness.


00:13:31.727 --> 00:13:37.691
Countless Zenithians lost their lives
sealing him away all those years ago.


00:13:38.734 --> 00:13:39.902
Ladja...


00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:42.613
so that's his plan.


00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:43.989
Looks that way.


00:13:44.532 --> 00:13:47.326
That's why I'm searching
for the heavenly hero,


00:13:47.409 --> 00:13:49.370
the one who can stop Bishop Ladja.


00:13:50.496 --> 00:13:51.455
Now...


00:13:52.498 --> 00:13:54.583
tell me everything you know.


00:14:03.592 --> 00:14:05.678
Don't stop until you reach Littlehaven.


00:14:06.929 --> 00:14:08.931
Hey, can you hear me?


00:14:09.682 --> 00:14:11.976
This is the best I can do.


00:14:12.476 --> 00:14:14.770
You're on your own from here.


00:14:15.938 --> 00:14:17.356
Farewell and Goddesspeed...


00:14:18.232 --> 00:14:20.192
you smelly sods.


00:14:32.913 --> 00:14:34.081
Halt!


00:14:34.164 --> 00:14:36.125
Beyond this point is Coburg territory.


00:14:36.542 --> 00:14:38.544
Outsiders are not permitted.


00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:42.214
You always were a jobsworth, Frank.


00:14:43.841 --> 00:14:45.384
Do I know you?


00:14:46.176 --> 00:14:48.470
Are you still afraid of frogs?


00:14:49.138 --> 00:14:52.224
Do you remember when I put one
in your bed? That was classic!


00:14:53.642 --> 00:14:56.353
You snobby little...


00:14:57.146 --> 00:14:58.939
Could it be...?


00:14:59.607 --> 00:15:03.068
Prince Harry! You're alive!


00:15:03.152 --> 00:15:04.570
Stand aside, Frank.


00:15:05.779 --> 00:15:09.408
The monsters on Mount Azimuth
are growing in strength.


00:15:09.491 --> 00:15:11.243
I must inform my father at once.


00:15:12.161 --> 00:15:13.329
Come on, Luca.


00:15:13.871 --> 00:15:14.997
Yeah...


00:15:15.915 --> 00:15:16.999
about that...


00:15:17.374 --> 00:15:19.793
Aren't you coming with me?


00:15:20.961 --> 00:15:22.087
It's my dad.


00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:26.842
His last words are playing on my mind.


00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:32.181
It's like he was trying to tell me
something important.


00:15:34.516 --> 00:15:36.185
About your mother?


00:15:36.977 --> 00:15:38.020
I think so.


00:15:38.395 --> 00:15:41.398
I want to go back to Whealbrook.


00:15:41.649 --> 00:15:43.943
There's an old cabin there
where we used to live.


00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:45.986
I see.


00:15:47.112 --> 00:15:49.573
We part ways here then.


00:15:49.657 --> 00:15:52.284
Take care, Harry.


00:15:52.785 --> 00:15:56.956
<i>I told you it's Prince Harry.
You're certainly a slow learner, lackey.</i>


00:15:57.039 --> 00:15:57.998
Be off with you.


00:15:58.582 --> 00:15:59.458
Right.


00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.587
I'll be back in Coburg one day.
So, until we meet again.


00:16:10.719 --> 00:16:11.553
Luca!


00:16:11.637 --> 00:16:12.471
Ouch...


00:16:16.141 --> 00:16:17.393
What is it?


00:16:17.893 --> 00:16:18.852
I...


00:16:19.853 --> 00:16:23.607
Sorry for not telling you
this sooner, but...


00:16:24.775 --> 00:16:25.776
you see...


00:16:26.944 --> 00:16:30.781
your father... Pankraz...


00:16:31.323 --> 00:16:32.658
I believe...


00:16:32.741 --> 00:16:34.201
no, I know that...


00:16:35.327 --> 00:16:37.454
he saved my life.


00:16:40.749 --> 00:16:41.917
What I mean is...


00:16:42.793 --> 00:16:45.629
if you need anything of me, just ask.


00:16:46.755 --> 00:16:48.424
I'll do all in my power to help.


00:17:02.396 --> 00:17:04.940
Ah, Whealbrook.
This place hasn't changed at all.


00:17:20.079 --> 00:17:22.665
Well, Dad, I'm home.


00:17:27.253 --> 00:17:28.589
It's freezing here!


00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:44.646
Let's get a fire lit.


00:18:07.586 --> 00:18:08.879
What is this place?


00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:11.381
Dad's secret room?


00:18:22.351 --> 00:18:23.560
And this is...


00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:25.813
his diary.


00:18:27.606 --> 00:18:30.734
<i>At long last, the question
that has plagued me is answered.</i>


00:18:32.277 --> 00:18:35.906
<i>Bishop Ladja requires the Zenithian spell
to open the gates to Nadiria.</i>


00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:39.243
<i>That is why he took Mada,
she is a Zenithian.</i>


00:18:40.536 --> 00:18:42.037
<i>This means she is still alive.</i>


00:18:43.122 --> 00:18:45.791
<i>If I can find the Zenithian sword
and the heavenly hero</i>


00:18:46.375 --> 00:18:48.585
<i>and seal the gates to the dark world,</i>


00:18:49.294 --> 00:18:50.879
<i>she may yet be saved.</i>


00:18:52.965 --> 00:18:54.049
<i>Furthermore,</i>


00:18:54.508 --> 00:18:58.387
<i>I believe Luca is the very hero of heaven
that I have been searching for.</i>


00:19:00.139 --> 00:19:01.682
I don't get it...


00:19:02.724 --> 00:19:04.351
Me? The hero?


00:19:16.905 --> 00:19:18.365
Begone, brutish burglar!


00:19:19.867 --> 00:19:20.868
But this is...


00:19:21.243 --> 00:19:23.078
my house!


00:19:25.622 --> 00:19:26.790
Sancho?


00:19:27.749 --> 00:19:28.917
Those eyes...


00:19:29.585 --> 00:19:31.378
Master Luca, it's you!


00:19:32.796 --> 00:19:35.507
Praise be! You're alive!


00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:45.309
This tastes even better than I remember!


00:19:45.392 --> 00:19:49.813
There's seconds if you need.
Oh, this is a truly happy day!


00:19:53.817 --> 00:19:56.737
I never gave up hope.


00:19:57.196 --> 00:19:59.823
I knew you were alive. I knew it!


00:19:59.907 --> 00:20:02.576
Ladja enslaved me
and forced me to build his temple.


00:20:02.659 --> 00:20:04.328
It was hell.


00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:06.538
Have you word of Lady Mada?


00:20:06.622 --> 00:20:09.833
Ladja has her held captive.
It says so in dad's diary.


00:20:09.917 --> 00:20:11.960
She was so close and I never knew.


00:20:12.544 --> 00:20:14.963
So, you did not see her?


00:20:15.047 --> 00:20:17.591
How could I? I was a slave!


00:20:17.674 --> 00:20:20.552
They worked me into the ground every day.


00:20:21.762 --> 00:20:22.763
What?


00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:26.183
If anyone can save her,
Master Luca, it is you.


00:20:26.266 --> 00:20:27.226
Me?


00:20:27.309 --> 00:20:30.604
Zenithian blood flows in your veins.
Your eyes are proof of that.


00:20:30.687 --> 00:20:33.190
You must be the heavenly hero of Zenithia.


00:20:33.273 --> 00:20:36.151
Don't be ridiculous.


00:20:36.235 --> 00:20:39.238
Lord Pankraz must have believed so, too.


00:20:39.321 --> 00:20:41.698
Well, that's what it said in his diary.


00:20:41.782 --> 00:20:42.824
You see?


00:20:42.908 --> 00:20:44.952
Your father also said this:


00:20:45.035 --> 00:20:48.872
the Zenithian sword
can only be unsheathed by the true hero.


00:20:48.956 --> 00:20:52.584
If he were to hurl the heavenly blade
into the gates to Nadiria,


00:20:52.668 --> 00:20:54.336
they will be sealed once more!


00:20:54.419 --> 00:20:57.881
So, where is this almighty sword then?


00:20:57.965 --> 00:20:59.633
Worry not.


00:20:59.716 --> 00:21:03.762
Rodrigo Briscoletti has it.
He said so in a letter.


00:21:03.845 --> 00:21:05.347
So, it does exist.


00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:10.727
Master Luca, you must go to Mostroferrato
and pay Mr. Briscoletti a visit.


00:21:11.186 --> 00:21:12.646
Mostroferrato?


00:21:12.938 --> 00:21:14.439
But it'll take weeks.


00:21:14.523 --> 00:21:18.151
What about all the forests,
the caves, the deserts, the monsters?


00:21:18.235 --> 00:21:22.197
Please, take this.
It belonged to your father.


00:21:23.073 --> 00:21:24.950
Dad's sword.


00:21:26.159 --> 00:21:28.287
I'm not fit to carry that.


00:21:28.704 --> 00:21:32.624
Look, I'm not my dad. I'll never make it.


00:21:33.292 --> 00:21:34.668
And I'm scared...


00:21:35.294 --> 00:21:38.046
too scared to even think about it.


00:21:43.677 --> 00:21:45.595
Sancho, can you tell me about my mom?


00:21:46.346 --> 00:21:49.349
She was a beautiful, intelligent lady.


00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:52.644
I can barely remember her at all.


00:21:53.478 --> 00:21:57.399
Come here, Luca. Come to Mommy.


00:21:59.151 --> 00:22:02.195
Your hands are so warm.


00:22:03.238 --> 00:22:07.492
On his life,
your father swore to save his queen.


00:22:08.952 --> 00:22:10.037
Luca...


00:22:11.038 --> 00:22:12.205
you must...


00:22:37.022 --> 00:22:39.775
I can make it! I will make it!


00:23:03.048 --> 00:23:04.508
Woo-hoo! Jackpot!


00:23:04.591 --> 00:23:06.593
Swoosh!


00:23:11.181 --> 00:23:12.516
What do you want?


00:23:13.392 --> 00:23:16.061
I don't need a slime for company.


00:23:22.818 --> 00:23:25.779
I'm really getting the hang of this.


00:23:27.614 --> 00:23:28.448
Eh?


00:23:29.199 --> 00:23:31.993
You won't leave me alone, huh?


00:23:32.077 --> 00:23:34.371
Maybe I'll keep you, then.


00:23:35.497 --> 00:23:36.915
Come along, Goo.


00:23:39.584 --> 00:23:40.585
Gootrude!


00:23:43.296 --> 00:23:48.468
Dad, do you really think I'm the hero?


00:23:48.552 --> 00:23:52.889
This was a mistake.
This whole journey was a big mistake.


00:23:53.932 --> 00:23:54.850
Just...


00:23:55.642 --> 00:23:57.185
just try to keep calm.


00:23:57.269 --> 00:23:59.479
See? I'm not going to hurt you.


00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:01.523
Just forget we ever came.


00:24:02.065 --> 00:24:02.941
Ready...


00:24:03.483 --> 00:24:04.609
steady...


00:24:06.736 --> 00:24:08.613
run for it!


00:24:09.156 --> 00:24:12.284
This can't be happening!


00:24:18.874 --> 00:24:19.875
Huh?


00:24:19.958 --> 00:24:20.917
Purrcy?


00:24:21.334 --> 00:24:23.920
Purrcy! It's you!


00:24:27.382 --> 00:24:28.550
Not far now.


00:24:38.226 --> 00:24:39.978
What happened here?


00:24:42.939 --> 00:24:45.484
WHOSOEVER CAN DEFEAT BJØRN THE BEHEMOOSE,


00:24:45.567 --> 00:24:47.235
I WILL MAKE MY HEIR


00:24:47.319 --> 00:24:49.571
- RODRIGO BRISCOLETTI


00:24:50.989 --> 00:24:53.992
So, this Bjørn fella is the one
who wrecked the place.


00:24:54.409 --> 00:24:57.704
Since word got out that Mr. Briscoletti's
heirship was up for grabs,


00:24:57.787 --> 00:25:01.041
we've had dozens of brave men
come to take on Bjørn.


00:25:01.124 --> 00:25:03.793
We never see any of them again, though.


00:25:03.877 --> 00:25:04.920
Whoa.


00:25:05.003 --> 00:25:07.297
He's absolutely ginormous.


00:25:11.468 --> 00:25:14.930
He's made the old sanctuary into his lair.


00:25:15.680 --> 00:25:17.140
This is bad.


00:25:28.818 --> 00:25:30.487
What am I to do?


00:25:32.906 --> 00:25:36.785
A new challenger? A monster master, maybe?


00:25:37.911 --> 00:25:40.205
He's the one to beat Bjørn!


00:25:40.789 --> 00:25:41.623
Father!


00:25:41.706 --> 00:25:45.043
Ah, Nera. A new suitor has just arrived.


00:25:46.461 --> 00:25:51.091
I'm still against
having my husband decided like this.


00:25:51.883 --> 00:25:53.385
This is not the time!


00:25:53.468 --> 00:25:55.720
I'm going to ask him to leave.


00:25:55.804 --> 00:25:57.806
No, stop. Please!


00:26:00.225 --> 00:26:02.143
Huh? What's that noise?


00:26:05.272 --> 00:26:06.898
Ouch...


00:26:07.274 --> 00:26:08.275
Are you alright?


00:26:15.907 --> 00:26:17.075
Are you...?


00:26:18.368 --> 00:26:19.411
You're...


00:26:20.203 --> 00:26:21.746
Nera?


00:26:24.416 --> 00:26:25.667
Luca...


00:26:27.210 --> 00:26:28.712
you're alive.


00:26:29.296 --> 00:26:30.255
Uh-huh!


00:26:39.639 --> 00:26:41.141
Is something the matter, Nera?


00:26:43.560 --> 00:26:44.394
You...


00:26:44.811 --> 00:26:46.146
It cannot be!


00:26:47.689 --> 00:26:51.109
Luca, we thought you were dead.


00:26:51.192 --> 00:26:55.614
Nera cried for days on end when she heard.


00:26:55.989 --> 00:26:57.449
She did?


00:26:58.450 --> 00:27:02.203
So, do you wish to challenge Bjørn?


00:27:03.747 --> 00:27:06.249
I never said anything of the sort.


00:27:06.333 --> 00:27:10.503
If you can defeat Bjørn,
I will name you my heir.


00:27:10.587 --> 00:27:14.299
In other words, you will take Nera's hand.


00:27:14.382 --> 00:27:15.383
In...


00:27:15.675 --> 00:27:16.801
in marriage?


00:27:16.885 --> 00:27:19.346
Quite the prize, eh?


00:27:19.429 --> 00:27:20.472
Whoa.


00:27:20.555 --> 00:27:22.724
You're ignoring one important thing.


00:27:22.807 --> 00:27:25.393
I don't stand a chance against Bjørn.


00:27:28.647 --> 00:27:30.065
I'm sure you'll be fine.


00:27:30.148 --> 00:27:33.401
What are you saying? Just look at me.


00:27:33.485 --> 00:27:36.446
The color of your eyes tells me so.


00:27:36.905 --> 00:27:39.616
So, you think I'm the Zenithian hero, too?


00:27:40.075 --> 00:27:43.495
We'll know for sure
if you can unsheathe the Zenithian sword.


00:27:43.578 --> 00:27:45.747
You really have it?


00:27:45.830 --> 00:27:49.876
<i>Sounds to me like you want to be the hero.</i>


00:27:51.836 --> 00:27:55.048
The sword is kept in here.


00:27:55.799 --> 00:27:59.427
Unsheathe it and fulfill your destiny,
Hero of Zenithia!


00:28:11.106 --> 00:28:12.941
It's gone.


00:28:14.734 --> 00:28:19.739
So, does this mean
the sword is in Bjørn's lair now?


00:28:20.657 --> 00:28:22.534
It would seem that way.


00:28:24.244 --> 00:28:25.286
Sorry...


00:28:25.787 --> 00:28:28.373
do you mind
if I think this through a little?


00:28:35.630 --> 00:28:36.798
Luca...


00:28:38.091 --> 00:28:39.718
Nera.


00:28:42.387 --> 00:28:45.014
I take it,
you've decided not to fight Bjørn.


00:28:45.098 --> 00:28:48.601
I think it's a battle too far for me.


00:28:48.685 --> 00:28:50.145
I'm glad.


00:28:50.228 --> 00:28:54.607
I don't know what I'd do
if you were to challenge him.


00:28:54.941 --> 00:28:57.152
Would you rather I didn't?


00:28:58.486 --> 00:29:02.073
I mean, if I beat him, then...


00:29:02.907 --> 00:29:04.200
we'd have to...


00:29:04.284 --> 00:29:05.201
you know...


00:29:05.285 --> 00:29:07.871
No, that's not what I mean.
Quite the opposite.


00:29:07.954 --> 00:29:12.375
I'd be absolutely delighted
to see you beat that brute. It's just...


00:29:12.459 --> 00:29:13.626
Delighted?


00:29:15.044 --> 00:29:18.047
No! Well, yes, but in a general sense.


00:29:18.131 --> 00:29:20.508
It's got nothing to do with marrying you.


00:29:20.592 --> 00:29:23.344
Not that I don't want to...


00:29:25.013 --> 00:29:26.639
Sorry, I really must leave!


00:29:32.437 --> 00:29:33.605
What just...?


00:29:34.481 --> 00:29:37.817
This means... She means... We can...


00:29:56.002 --> 00:29:57.045
Anyone...


00:29:57.587 --> 00:30:00.256
medicinal herbs, please?


00:30:02.091 --> 00:30:05.053
-Anyone still got some?
-Nope, I'm out.


00:30:05.136 --> 00:30:06.346
Used mine up.


00:30:06.429 --> 00:30:07.680
I have some.


00:30:08.807 --> 00:30:11.976
-Who's that?
-Some girl who arrived yesterday.


00:30:14.145 --> 00:30:16.606
You've grown, Purrcy.


00:30:18.608 --> 00:30:19.567
Here...


00:30:19.651 --> 00:30:20.985
here you go.


00:30:28.785 --> 00:30:30.161
You're a lifesaver.


00:30:30.745 --> 00:30:33.540
I thought I recognized you
for a second there.


00:30:33.623 --> 00:30:34.457
Huh?


00:30:34.958 --> 00:30:39.254
You look a lot like the guy who
got rid of the ghosts in Uptaten Towers.


00:30:39.629 --> 00:30:41.923
Where did you hear about that?


00:30:42.340 --> 00:30:45.969
How could you forget
a childhood friend, eh?


00:30:47.095 --> 00:30:49.931
No way... Bianca?


00:30:50.014 --> 00:30:54.018
Took you long enough, Luca Erkel Gotha.


00:30:54.102 --> 00:30:57.397
Bianca! It's really you!


00:30:57.480 --> 00:31:00.275
-I've heard of Bianca.
-What? The mage?


00:31:00.358 --> 00:31:02.068
They say she can use Kasizzle.


00:31:02.485 --> 00:31:03.820
Come along.


00:31:09.117 --> 00:31:11.452
Hey! Where are you going?


00:31:12.662 --> 00:31:13.496
What?


00:31:13.580 --> 00:31:16.124
You're not thinking
of fighting Bjørn with me, are you?


00:31:16.207 --> 00:31:18.042
Well, you clearly can't beat him alone.


00:31:18.126 --> 00:31:20.253
I'd rather you just left it to me.


00:31:20.336 --> 00:31:22.255
Have I done something to offend you?


00:31:22.338 --> 00:31:23.756
Of course not.


00:31:23.840 --> 00:31:26.509
Just don't try following me!


00:31:27.552 --> 00:31:29.846
Why doesn't he want me to go with him?


00:31:34.392 --> 00:31:36.394
What's your problem?


00:31:36.477 --> 00:31:38.187
I don't have a problem.


00:31:38.271 --> 00:31:40.440
Look, this place is really dangerous.


00:31:42.025 --> 00:31:43.109
Oh?


00:31:43.651 --> 00:31:45.528
I never knew you as the chivalrous type.


00:31:45.612 --> 00:31:46.613
Give it a rest.


00:31:48.281 --> 00:31:49.282
Over there!


00:31:49.365 --> 00:31:50.199
Is that...?


00:31:54.078 --> 00:31:56.205
The Zenithian sword!


00:31:56.289 --> 00:32:00.209
-With that, you'll be invincible!
-Wait! It's not safe!


00:32:00.293 --> 00:32:03.296
Huh? Too dangerous
for the so-called "heavenly hero"?


00:32:03.379 --> 00:32:04.839
Not you too.


00:32:05.340 --> 00:32:07.258
Strike first and we can win.


00:32:12.555 --> 00:32:17.560
Who dares disturb my beauty sleep?


00:32:17.644 --> 00:32:19.854
-Here he comes.
-He's huge!


00:32:20.271 --> 00:32:23.858
Back again, little boy?


00:32:23.942 --> 00:32:25.944
You're a glutton for punishment.


00:32:32.700 --> 00:32:36.955
Bianca, you find the sword,
I'll keep Bjørn busy.


00:32:37.038 --> 00:32:38.039
Right!


00:32:38.122 --> 00:32:39.374
We can do this!


00:32:40.667 --> 00:32:41.960
Swoosh!


00:32:43.461 --> 00:32:45.254
It's draughty in here.


00:32:54.013 --> 00:32:55.807
Bianca! Have you found it?


00:32:55.890 --> 00:32:59.268
Not yet! I'm still looking!


00:32:59.352 --> 00:33:02.146
Hurry!


00:33:04.691 --> 00:33:08.444
What are you doing, Luca?
I'll never find it at this rate!


00:33:08.528 --> 00:33:11.364
Give me a break! I'm doing the best I can!


00:33:11.447 --> 00:33:13.783
Dodge this!


00:33:14.784 --> 00:33:15.994
Swoosh!


00:33:21.249 --> 00:33:22.625
You found it!


00:33:27.046 --> 00:33:29.173
Luca! Let's get out of here!


00:33:29.257 --> 00:33:30.341
Yes, let's!


00:33:30.425 --> 00:33:33.553
You hit my pretty face.


00:33:33.761 --> 00:33:35.263
Eat this!


00:33:42.937 --> 00:33:43.771
Luca!


00:33:50.653 --> 00:33:52.363
Alright!


00:33:53.031 --> 00:33:54.073
Bjørn!


00:33:54.574 --> 00:33:59.203
The Zenithian sword is mine!
Submit or taste its heavenly steel!


00:34:07.003 --> 00:34:08.838
Huh? Maybe like this?


00:34:13.509 --> 00:34:14.719
Damn it!


00:34:24.520 --> 00:34:25.563
The sword...


00:34:26.313 --> 00:34:27.607
it won't budge.


00:34:28.065 --> 00:34:29.317
What?


00:34:29.400 --> 00:34:32.152
So, you're not the hero after all?


00:34:32.235 --> 00:34:34.197
I don't think so.


00:34:37.742 --> 00:34:39.994
Today's menu, mixed grill!


00:34:40.078 --> 00:34:40.995
Uh-oh!


00:34:41.746 --> 00:34:44.373
-Owie!
-Owie!


00:34:50.797 --> 00:34:52.090
Bjørn is furious.


00:34:52.172 --> 00:34:54.092
Is that Luca?


00:34:54.592 --> 00:34:58.262
I'll destroy you all!


00:35:01.557 --> 00:35:03.684
You can't hide forever!


00:35:09.315 --> 00:35:10.983
There you are!


00:35:11.067 --> 00:35:12.068
Kasizzle!


00:35:15.446 --> 00:35:18.116
-He must have a weakness.
-But what?


00:35:22.662 --> 00:35:23.579
The eye...


00:35:24.288 --> 00:35:25.581
on his forehead.


00:35:29.127 --> 00:35:31.003
I know how to beat Bjørn.


00:35:31.087 --> 00:35:32.338
Really?


00:35:32.421 --> 00:35:34.882
Take cover over there, Purrcy.


00:35:39.303 --> 00:35:42.515
I'll need your help too, Gootrude.


00:35:45.184 --> 00:35:47.979
I've got you now!


00:35:57.780 --> 00:36:00.616
I hope you like a good barbecue.


00:36:00.700 --> 00:36:04.162
Actually, I prefer a fresh salad!


00:36:08.833 --> 00:36:09.959
Swoosh!


00:36:32.064 --> 00:36:36.569
Are you going to kill me?


00:36:38.070 --> 00:36:39.739
That's up to you, Bjørn.


00:36:40.072 --> 00:36:41.991
You can die now


00:36:42.074 --> 00:36:43.784
or swear loyalty to me.


00:36:57.506 --> 00:37:00.343
I don't want to die.


00:37:01.886 --> 00:37:04.013
We did it!


00:37:04.722 --> 00:37:06.182
Luca!


00:37:09.769 --> 00:37:12.605
-Thank you!
-Our savior!


00:37:16.359 --> 00:37:18.569
Yeah, our great Zenithian hero.


00:37:19.111 --> 00:37:22.782
Let's just keep that
between you and me, okay?


00:37:23.741 --> 00:37:26.369
People are going
way over the top as it is.


00:37:26.452 --> 00:37:29.664
-Thank you!
-I feel like such a fraud.


00:37:29.747 --> 00:37:31.540
Look at it this way:


00:37:32.124 --> 00:37:36.462
you beat Bjørn
even though you're not the heavenly hero.


00:37:36.963 --> 00:37:38.381
That's quite an achievement.


00:37:39.090 --> 00:37:40.591
Luca!


00:37:41.467 --> 00:37:44.595
Well, I couldn't have done it without you.


00:37:45.346 --> 00:37:49.100
You've always had my back,
ever since we were little.


00:37:49.183 --> 00:37:51.352
First at Uptaten Towers, now here.


00:37:51.435 --> 00:37:56.315
That's nice of you.
So, you'll be generous with my cut?


00:37:56.691 --> 00:38:00.111
How many thousand gold coins
did Rodrigo Briscoletti promise you?


00:38:02.655 --> 00:38:04.949
Actually, the reward for beating Bjørn


00:38:05.866 --> 00:38:08.869
is Nera's hand in marriage.


00:38:09.287 --> 00:38:10.121
Nera?


00:38:12.206 --> 00:38:13.541
That's great.


00:38:14.333 --> 00:38:15.793
Nera Briscoletti.


00:38:15.876 --> 00:38:18.879
You'll be the envy
of every man in the land.


00:38:19.505 --> 00:38:20.589
Well...


00:38:21.090 --> 00:38:23.175
So, that's what this was all about.


00:38:24.302 --> 00:38:27.179
You can wipe that smug grin off your face.


00:38:34.687 --> 00:38:36.689
You still have to propose properly,
remember?


00:38:37.481 --> 00:38:40.276
Most girls want
their future hubby to pop the question.


00:38:40.359 --> 00:38:44.447
It's infinitely better
than having your parents do it instead.


00:38:44.530 --> 00:38:46.490
I'm not an idiot.


00:38:46.949 --> 00:38:49.452
So, why are you here again?


00:38:49.535 --> 00:38:52.455
Think you can do this alone? Not a chance.


00:38:52.872 --> 00:38:57.460
But we've been through a lot.
It's only right I help you.


00:38:57.543 --> 00:39:00.880
-Compassion is my strong suit.
-Well, I won't be needing it.


00:39:00.963 --> 00:39:03.341
Anyway, it's time you left.


00:39:03.424 --> 00:39:04.925
Get going!


00:39:05.551 --> 00:39:08.220
-Stop mothering me.
-Luca!


00:39:08.679 --> 00:39:09.847
Oh! Hello!


00:39:12.141 --> 00:39:15.519
I hear you completed the quest.
Father is over the moon.


00:39:17.063 --> 00:39:19.148
Yeah, but it was touch and go.


00:39:19.607 --> 00:39:20.775
So...


00:39:21.400 --> 00:39:22.443
well...


00:39:24.653 --> 00:39:28.324
How should I put it? Let me see...


00:39:30.868 --> 00:39:32.870
Sorry to interrupt.


00:39:32.953 --> 00:39:33.913
Ouch.


00:39:33.996 --> 00:39:35.206
Bianca?


00:39:35.998 --> 00:39:38.209
What's with you? You're a nervous wreck!


00:39:38.292 --> 00:39:40.961
The words just won't come out!


00:39:41.045 --> 00:39:42.254
Ugh! Useless!


00:39:42.338 --> 00:39:44.965
That hurts! Stop tugging!


00:39:45.883 --> 00:39:49.762
This wet blanket
has something to ask you, Nera.


00:39:49.845 --> 00:39:51.639
Shut up.


00:39:53.307 --> 00:39:54.558
Well...


00:39:55.684 --> 00:39:59.188
um... will you...


00:40:00.064 --> 00:40:01.982
Will you marry me?


00:40:03.984 --> 00:40:05.194
Yes, of course!


00:40:05.820 --> 00:40:07.196
Really?


00:40:08.280 --> 00:40:10.699
Oh, I'm so happy you asked.


00:40:10.783 --> 00:40:15.621
I was worried you might not propose,
even if you defeated the monster.


00:40:17.915 --> 00:40:21.335
Will Bianca give us her blessing?


00:40:21.419 --> 00:40:23.087
I'm sure she will.


00:40:23.170 --> 00:40:26.799
She was instrumental in defeating Bjørn.


00:40:27.299 --> 00:40:30.469
She's been nagging
after a cut of the reward ever since.


00:40:30.803 --> 00:40:33.722
She hasn't changed one jot
since we were kids.


00:40:34.306 --> 00:40:37.810
She always says the first thing
that comes into her head.


00:40:39.019 --> 00:40:42.440
<i>Come, eat up. You're family now.</i>


00:40:42.523 --> 00:40:43.399
<i>Family?</i>


00:41:01.000 --> 00:41:03.210
Me of all people...


00:41:03.586 --> 00:41:05.087
married.


00:41:05.796 --> 00:41:07.214
To Bianca!


00:41:07.298 --> 00:41:10.217
-Cheers!
-How many have I had now?


00:41:10.301 --> 00:41:12.052
Sounds like some party.


00:41:18.642 --> 00:41:20.686
Oh, Lord Luca.


00:41:21.270 --> 00:41:25.816
Everyone! The slayer of Bjørn is here!
The heavenly hero himself!


00:41:25.900 --> 00:41:27.193
Oh, no, I mean...


00:41:27.276 --> 00:41:30.696
Luca the monster master!


00:41:34.200 --> 00:41:36.327
Here, get this down you.


00:41:36.410 --> 00:41:37.703
No, thanks.


00:41:37.786 --> 00:41:41.290
But we're celebrating your engagement.


00:41:41.373 --> 00:41:43.876
Look, I've had a busy day is all.


00:41:43.959 --> 00:41:44.877
Huh?


00:41:45.794 --> 00:41:48.422
I'll catch you guys tomorrow.


00:41:48.506 --> 00:41:51.300
Hey! Luca!


00:41:52.384 --> 00:41:56.263
Are you saying you won't drink with me?


00:41:56.347 --> 00:41:58.390
Good night, everyone!


00:41:59.141 --> 00:42:01.227
And, Bianca, try not to drink too much.


00:42:01.310 --> 00:42:03.229
Wait!


00:42:05.105 --> 00:42:06.398
Stupid lunkhead.


00:42:09.109 --> 00:42:10.361
Bottoms up!


00:42:10.444 --> 00:42:14.448
When did she start drinking like a fish?


00:42:20.246 --> 00:42:21.914
Can I help you?


00:42:23.999 --> 00:42:26.126
Hey, hey! What are you doing?


00:42:26.627 --> 00:42:30.589
Those eyes. Come closer so I can see.


00:42:30.923 --> 00:42:31.757
Huh?


00:42:32.258 --> 00:42:33.425
Yes.


00:42:33.842 --> 00:42:37.137
You're apprehensive about getting married.


00:42:37.221 --> 00:42:38.097
Eh?


00:42:38.556 --> 00:42:41.225
Well, I am tying the knot soon,


00:42:41.308 --> 00:42:43.018
but I'm not worried one bit.


00:42:43.769 --> 00:42:46.438
She's a wonderful woman.


00:42:46.522 --> 00:42:49.316
I couldn't be happier right now.


00:42:50.192 --> 00:42:52.194
Hmm, that's strange.


00:42:52.278 --> 00:42:56.282
Your eyes tell a different story.


00:42:56.365 --> 00:42:59.868
They say you're hiding your true feelings.


00:43:00.578 --> 00:43:04.707
Did you put a spell on yourself?


00:43:05.541 --> 00:43:07.585
Don't be ridiculous.


00:43:08.127 --> 00:43:10.462
I'm very tired, so if that's everything...


00:43:10.546 --> 00:43:11.714
Goodbye.


00:43:13.215 --> 00:43:18.971
Don't you want
to face up to your true feelings?


00:43:19.930 --> 00:43:23.475
I'll be fine. I only ever follow my heart.


00:43:24.059 --> 00:43:25.936
Hey! Don't barge your way in!


00:43:26.312 --> 00:43:29.189
If you're so sure about yourself,


00:43:29.607 --> 00:43:31.692
then drink this.


00:43:32.151 --> 00:43:34.653
It's a special potion.


00:43:34.737 --> 00:43:37.448
Drinking it
will reveal your true feelings.


00:43:37.531 --> 00:43:42.411
If you wish to understand
your deepest emotions


00:43:42.494 --> 00:43:46.707
you should glug it down.


00:43:47.166 --> 00:43:51.879
If you say so, but there's no way
I'm drinking that muck. Goodbye.


00:43:51.962 --> 00:43:53.005
Just a second.


00:43:53.088 --> 00:43:57.051
If you won't drink it,
you must be in denial.


00:43:59.678 --> 00:44:04.266
Fine, fine.
I'll keep it, but I won't drink it.


00:44:04.350 --> 00:44:06.810
-You will.
-I won't.


00:44:06.894 --> 00:44:09.146
No, no, no. You'll drink it.


00:44:14.610 --> 00:44:16.278
What a loony.


00:44:30.876 --> 00:44:32.294
Argh!


00:44:38.008 --> 00:44:40.719
It probably won't even do anything.


00:44:50.437 --> 00:44:53.691
<i>Nera... Nera... Choose Nera.</i>


00:44:54.274 --> 00:44:55.943
SELF-SUGGESTION


00:44:56.026 --> 00:44:58.112
<i>Nera... Nera... Choose Nera.</i>


00:44:58.195 --> 00:45:01.657
<i>Nera... Choose Nera.</i>


00:45:08.330 --> 00:45:11.125
LUCA'S SUBCONSCIOUS


00:45:18.090 --> 00:45:18.924
Huh?


00:45:22.761 --> 00:45:24.513
No, no, no. No way.


00:45:25.931 --> 00:45:27.391
It's nothing.


00:45:27.808 --> 00:45:30.144
That old hag was just winding me up.


00:45:35.357 --> 00:45:37.651
Oh, what have I done?


00:45:38.068 --> 00:45:41.196
Who said it again, all those years ago?


00:45:43.532 --> 00:45:48.203
"Your true love is someone
you can tell anything to."


00:45:49.037 --> 00:45:51.915
Am I right?


00:45:53.125 --> 00:45:56.587
I am right, aren't I?


00:45:57.963 --> 00:45:59.298
This is bad. Really bad.


00:46:00.382 --> 00:46:01.216
Huh?


00:46:06.930 --> 00:46:08.432
What's she doing here?


00:46:09.850 --> 00:46:12.436
I think I finally know how I feel.


00:46:15.272 --> 00:46:16.190
What?


00:46:16.774 --> 00:46:19.109
You want to call off the engagement?


00:46:19.193 --> 00:46:20.068
Yes.


00:46:20.152 --> 00:46:23.322
It's a little late for that,
don't you think?


00:46:23.405 --> 00:46:25.783
No one's more surprised than I am...


00:46:26.575 --> 00:46:29.953
Keep it down. Nera will overhear.


00:46:30.037 --> 00:46:34.583
I'm sorry for standing Nera up like this.


00:46:34.666 --> 00:46:37.169
I know what you're saying.


00:46:37.252 --> 00:46:41.173
You don't care about Nera
or the Briscoletti family.


00:46:41.256 --> 00:46:43.300
That's taking it too far.


00:46:43.383 --> 00:46:46.553
My feelings for Nera were real.


00:46:46.637 --> 00:46:48.388
Then why?


00:46:49.640 --> 00:46:53.352
I just came to understand
that my heart belongs to someone else.


00:46:53.435 --> 00:46:55.020
I couldn't lie to myself.


00:46:57.523 --> 00:46:59.900
You are rude and ungrateful.


00:46:59.983 --> 00:47:03.362
The mere sight of you makes me sick.
Get out of this town!


00:47:05.239 --> 00:47:07.658
You should have this back.


00:47:08.534 --> 00:47:10.285
I'm not the hero after all.


00:47:19.086 --> 00:47:20.170
Wait a moment.


00:47:21.296 --> 00:47:22.297
What is it?


00:47:22.923 --> 00:47:26.093
You're going to search for the hero,
aren't you?


00:47:27.135 --> 00:47:28.136
Yes.


00:47:28.220 --> 00:47:31.056
Then take it with you.


00:47:31.139 --> 00:47:31.974
Really?


00:47:32.516 --> 00:47:35.936
Find the hero and go to the town
at the foot of Mount Azimuth.


00:47:36.603 --> 00:47:38.105
I don't understand.


00:47:38.897 --> 00:47:42.276
I hear the Zenith Dragon lives there,
disguised as a human.


00:47:42.818 --> 00:47:44.319
You must seek its help.


00:47:44.820 --> 00:47:46.363
Why me?


00:47:46.446 --> 00:47:48.991
Do you see that mountain?


00:47:49.074 --> 00:47:52.286
Dark forces are at work there.


00:47:52.369 --> 00:47:55.122
It gives me great cause for concern.


00:47:57.165 --> 00:48:01.044
Oh, and if anyone asks,
I'm absolutely furious with you.


00:48:01.503 --> 00:48:02.671
Got it?


00:48:02.754 --> 00:48:04.089
You have my word.


00:48:04.673 --> 00:48:07.134
Now, get out of here, you scoundrel.


00:48:07.759 --> 00:48:09.469
You are never to see Nera again.


00:48:10.470 --> 00:48:14.057
Oh, Nera, my poor baby girl.


00:48:16.602 --> 00:48:17.728
Nera...


00:48:19.396 --> 00:48:20.397
I'm sorry.


00:48:21.356 --> 00:48:25.152
What? Have you lost your mind?
How could you be so stupid?


00:48:25.527 --> 00:48:27.821
Only an idiot would jilt a girl like Nera.


00:48:27.905 --> 00:48:33.368
Well, officially,
Rodrigo and I had a big falling out.


00:48:33.452 --> 00:48:35.495
Look, that's him.


00:48:35.579 --> 00:48:37.456
Poor guy.


00:48:37.831 --> 00:48:39.875
Are you saying you didn't?


00:48:40.334 --> 00:48:43.170
I bet you made it all up
because you're so embarrassed.


00:48:43.712 --> 00:48:46.423
But if what you're saying is true,


00:48:46.506 --> 00:48:52.471
then congratulations,
you are officially the new village idiot!


00:48:52.554 --> 00:48:54.806
I realized there's someone
more important to me.


00:48:54.890 --> 00:48:56.808
What's that supposed to mean?


00:48:57.434 --> 00:49:01.271
Don't tell me you fell for some girl
who gave you a puff-puff downtown?


00:49:01.355 --> 00:49:03.023
You've always been...


00:49:03.106 --> 00:49:08.028
We've always been there for each other
when we're in a spot of bother.


00:49:08.111 --> 00:49:10.697
Hey, where are you going?


00:49:11.198 --> 00:49:12.449
She's always so bossy,


00:49:13.533 --> 00:49:15.619
and she never knows when to shut up...


00:49:18.038 --> 00:49:20.290
but she has the cutest smile.


00:49:32.427 --> 00:49:35.806
Now, just hang on a minute.
You've definitely lost your mind.


00:49:36.431 --> 00:49:38.225
You're going to regret this!


00:49:38.642 --> 00:49:40.477
-Don't say...
-Bianca Whitaker...


00:49:40.936 --> 00:49:42.062
Yes!


00:49:42.145 --> 00:49:44.898
I, Luca Erkel Gotha,


00:49:45.816 --> 00:49:49.903
would be honored
if we could be together forevermore.


00:49:54.908 --> 00:49:56.201
You said it.


00:49:57.953 --> 00:49:58.954
You...


00:50:00.247 --> 00:50:01.790
really said it.


00:50:03.667 --> 00:50:05.460
You can't take that back, you know?


00:50:06.837 --> 00:50:08.005
Because I...


00:50:09.214 --> 00:50:10.966
I feel the same way, too.


00:50:35.532 --> 00:50:37.325
Oh, that's...


00:50:40.287 --> 00:50:41.496
Hey!


00:50:43.290 --> 00:50:47.127
I see you've come to your senses.


00:50:47.544 --> 00:50:49.588
You've got a lot to answer for.


00:50:51.548 --> 00:50:53.759
I could have married
a kind, graceful woman,


00:50:53.842 --> 00:50:55.969
inherited the Briscoletti fortune,


00:50:56.053 --> 00:50:58.221
but it's all gone down the drain.


00:50:58.305 --> 00:51:03.769
Such things mean little if you have
to lie to yourself to get them.


00:51:03.852 --> 00:51:06.438
You'll never be happy that way.


00:51:06.521 --> 00:51:10.609
Still, you saw right through me
just by looking into my eyes.


00:51:10.692 --> 00:51:12.944
Even I didn't know how I felt.


00:51:13.070 --> 00:51:16.406
Never underestimate
a woman's intuition, boy.


00:51:16.823 --> 00:51:19.409
My sincerest apologies.


00:51:19.493 --> 00:51:22.954
Thanks for your wise words
and the special potion.


00:51:24.331 --> 00:51:25.332
I'll be off then.


00:51:38.095 --> 00:51:42.224
Perhaps I shouldn't have gone so far?


00:51:43.475 --> 00:51:46.478
But I couldn't help noticing...


00:51:47.729 --> 00:51:49.523
your true feelings.


00:52:00.367 --> 00:52:03.453
Thank you, Grandmaster Nimzo.


00:52:04.496 --> 00:52:05.747
Now, let's see...


00:52:13.630 --> 00:52:16.508
It would appear
that I still need more power,


00:52:16.591 --> 00:52:18.802
which I shall obtain,


00:52:19.386 --> 00:52:22.264
regardless
of what may befall my mortal frame.


00:52:23.598 --> 00:52:29.813
And when the time comes,
you shall be of great help, Mada.


00:53:23.658 --> 00:53:25.619
It's me, your daddy!


00:53:28.371 --> 00:53:32.918
Young Alus' eyes
are the same color as yours, Your Majesty.


00:53:33.001 --> 00:53:35.837
Yes, but his are much brighter.


00:53:37.297 --> 00:53:38.715
They're mesmerizing.


00:53:44.804 --> 00:53:46.765
It's been doing that a lot lately.


00:53:47.974 --> 00:53:51.311
Perhaps it's telling me to hurry up
and find the Zenithian hero.


00:53:51.978 --> 00:53:54.648
I've probably put it off
too long as it is.


00:53:54.981 --> 00:53:57.359
You're setting off so soon?


00:53:57.442 --> 00:53:58.318
Yeah.


00:53:59.277 --> 00:54:00.820
For Alus' sake...


00:54:01.696 --> 00:54:04.324
I can't let this world
fall to the darkness.


00:54:05.951 --> 00:54:06.952
I know.


00:54:09.412 --> 00:54:10.247
Huh?


00:54:11.456 --> 00:54:13.583
Look at you, Master Luca.


00:54:14.584 --> 00:54:16.044
You're all grown up.


00:54:16.127 --> 00:54:17.045
Well...


00:54:22.801 --> 00:54:24.135
Intruders!


00:54:30.934 --> 00:54:32.102
This way.


00:54:39.484 --> 00:54:41.236
They're down there!


00:54:50.954 --> 00:54:52.205
Luca!


00:54:55.875 --> 00:54:57.419
Head for Roundbeck.


00:54:58.503 --> 00:55:00.088
And keep Alus safe!


00:55:00.171 --> 00:55:02.424
Of course, Lady Bianca!


00:55:07.429 --> 00:55:09.931
I'll only lop off one of your legs,


00:55:10.015 --> 00:55:12.517
just as Bishop Ladja ordered.


00:55:16.604 --> 00:55:17.439
Luca!


00:55:17.897 --> 00:55:18.732
Bianca!


00:55:20.025 --> 00:55:21.443
Get away from him!


00:55:21.526 --> 00:55:23.903
Stay out of this, wretch!


00:55:23.987 --> 00:55:25.238
Kasnooze!


00:55:33.955 --> 00:55:35.040
Bianca!


00:55:35.749 --> 00:55:37.042
You're done for!


00:55:41.296 --> 00:55:43.256
-Oops.
-What did you do?


00:55:44.758 --> 00:55:46.176
I messed up.


00:55:46.760 --> 00:55:48.511
Words fail me.


00:56:06.154 --> 00:56:08.573
Well, this is less than ideal.


00:56:09.908 --> 00:56:11.034
Oh?


00:56:11.826 --> 00:56:13.453
This girl.


00:56:15.372 --> 00:56:16.956
My, my...


00:56:22.420 --> 00:56:23.588
Bianca!


00:56:31.679 --> 00:56:35.558
I was starting to think you'd never come.


00:56:37.060 --> 00:56:38.228
Ladja...


00:56:38.645 --> 00:56:44.609
I came here
to offer you the chance to see Mada...


00:56:46.111 --> 00:56:51.032
but I found myself
a nice surprise instead.


00:56:51.116 --> 00:56:53.827
What do you want with her, Ladja?


00:56:53.910 --> 00:56:57.997
I want her to open the gates to Nadiria


00:56:58.498 --> 00:57:03.169
as Mada is showing no sign of waking.


00:57:03.253 --> 00:57:06.256
But only Zenithians can open the gates.


00:57:06.339 --> 00:57:12.137
Oh, dear. He doesn't know, does he?


00:57:18.685 --> 00:57:22.564
All the same,
please accept my heartfelt thanks...


00:57:23.773 --> 00:57:27.110
for giving me such a splendid gift.


00:57:31.156 --> 00:57:32.323
Do not resist!


00:57:35.994 --> 00:57:37.454
I know.


00:57:37.954 --> 00:57:41.458
I have the perfect present just for you.


00:57:51.092 --> 00:57:53.052
Ka...swoosh!


00:58:13.615 --> 00:58:14.824
Stunning.


00:58:16.493 --> 00:58:18.411
Such an exquisite expression.


00:58:19.245 --> 00:58:20.955
You can watch from there.


00:58:22.707 --> 00:58:26.920
Watch as the world
is plunged into darkness.


00:58:56.032 --> 00:58:57.951
I still can't quite believe my luck.


00:58:59.244 --> 00:59:03.248
To think there was another
descended from Zenithian stock


00:59:03.665 --> 00:59:08.795
and she was wedded
to the son of Mada no less.


00:59:11.631 --> 00:59:12.549
Me?


00:59:13.424 --> 00:59:14.425
That's absurd.


00:59:15.093 --> 00:59:17.720
My eyes are the wrong color
for a Zenithian!


00:59:20.056 --> 00:59:21.391
Are you sure?


00:59:22.225 --> 00:59:24.894
Take a closer look at your face.


00:59:26.729 --> 00:59:31.442
I have good reason to believe
that you were adopted.


00:59:35.280 --> 00:59:37.156
To keep your little secret safe,


00:59:37.240 --> 00:59:42.620
your birth parents cast a spell
to change the color of your eyes.


00:59:43.329 --> 00:59:45.540
-Now, come with me.
-Let me go!


00:59:52.839 --> 00:59:55.341
-That's...
-Mada.


00:59:56.801 --> 01:00:00.930
She's been rather uncooperative,
as you can see from that barrier.


01:00:01.014 --> 01:00:02.348
I...


01:00:03.224 --> 01:00:05.852
Legend has it that the Zenithians


01:00:06.269 --> 01:00:08.938
can communicate using their minds.


01:00:10.607 --> 01:00:14.861
Have her teach you the spell
that opens the gates.


01:00:15.570 --> 01:00:18.406
Then, you can do for me what she will not.


01:00:19.741 --> 01:00:20.575
That's...


01:00:21.159 --> 01:00:23.077
the gateway to Nadiria.


01:00:23.953 --> 01:00:28.124
Grant me my wish and you have my word


01:00:28.833 --> 01:00:32.420
that I will set you free.


01:00:37.258 --> 01:00:40.011
<i>Mada.</i>


01:00:41.638 --> 01:00:43.765
<i>Who is it that would speak to me?</i>


01:00:43.848 --> 01:00:48.728
<i>My name is Bianca. I am Luca's wife.</i>


01:00:49.145 --> 01:00:52.148
<i>Ah, so my son has wed.</i>


01:00:52.899 --> 01:00:57.820
<i>Bianca, you must not lend a ear to Ladja,
no matter what he tells you.</i>


01:00:59.197 --> 01:01:01.783
<i>He is steadily growing in power,</i>


01:01:02.450 --> 01:01:05.328
<i>but the gates will not open</i>


01:01:05.870 --> 01:01:08.289
<i>unless a Zenithian casts the spell.</i>


01:01:10.375 --> 01:01:13.211
<i>Please, save yourself...</i>


01:01:14.671 --> 01:01:17.715
<i>and forgive me for being of little help.</i>


01:01:22.929 --> 01:01:25.765
Mada!


01:01:26.265 --> 01:01:31.229
Come now.
Show me the power of the Zenithians.


01:01:33.189 --> 01:01:34.691
Kafrizzle!


01:01:37.527 --> 01:01:41.197
Behave yourself now, Mrs. Gotha.


01:01:42.115 --> 01:01:44.867
It would be wise to obey me.


01:01:44.951 --> 01:01:45.868
Never!


01:01:45.952 --> 01:01:48.621
How unfortunate.


01:01:48.705 --> 01:01:50.123
Kasizzle!


01:01:50.206 --> 01:01:52.208
-You underestimate me.
-Kafrizzle!


01:01:52.875 --> 01:01:54.627
Kafrizzle!


01:01:55.420 --> 01:01:56.754
Cease this.


01:01:59.257 --> 01:02:01.342
You are but an insect to me.


01:02:01.926 --> 01:02:03.010
Give up!


01:02:04.220 --> 01:02:05.722
Ladja!


01:02:06.514 --> 01:02:07.473
Let me...


01:02:08.307 --> 01:02:09.851
help you up.


01:02:24.323 --> 01:02:27.201
One of my poorest pieces to date.


01:03:17.418 --> 01:03:18.669
Careful.


01:03:18.753 --> 01:03:20.004
Go slower.


01:03:28.971 --> 01:03:30.264
Finally, we've fou...


01:03:32.475 --> 01:03:34.560
Quick, pull me up!


01:03:47.240 --> 01:03:48.282
Hurry!


01:03:50.201 --> 01:03:51.410
Zoom!


01:04:20.815 --> 01:04:21.858
We did it!


01:04:21.941 --> 01:04:23.568
We finally did it!


01:04:24.902 --> 01:04:28.781
I don't know who you are, but thank you.


01:04:28.865 --> 01:04:30.867
How can you say that? I'm...


01:04:41.043 --> 01:04:42.461
That swordsmanship.


01:04:43.254 --> 01:04:45.464
Surely you're not...


01:04:45.548 --> 01:04:49.677
I thought you'd recognize
your own son a little quicker.


01:04:49.760 --> 01:04:50.595
It's me, Alus.


01:04:51.137 --> 01:04:54.432
But when did you get so...


01:04:55.308 --> 01:04:56.726
-Behind you!
-Huh?


01:05:04.066 --> 01:05:05.693
Alus, use this!


01:05:06.277 --> 01:05:07.403
Thanks, Dad!


01:05:08.279 --> 01:05:09.614
Wait, that sword's...


01:05:10.323 --> 01:05:11.365
Alus, stop!


01:05:11.449 --> 01:05:12.742
That's the Zenithian...


01:05:57.161 --> 01:05:58.829
Whoa!


01:05:58.913 --> 01:05:59.914
That was amazing!


01:05:59.997 --> 01:06:03.668
Dad, where did you get this sword?
It's brilliant!


01:06:05.002 --> 01:06:06.879
The Zenithian sword...


01:06:09.256 --> 01:06:10.549
He was...


01:06:11.676 --> 01:06:13.260
He was right here.


01:06:13.344 --> 01:06:14.887
The heavenly hero.


01:06:16.222 --> 01:06:18.307
It was you this whole time.


01:06:18.891 --> 01:06:21.435
Lord Luca!


01:06:21.936 --> 01:06:23.312
Sancho!


01:06:24.021 --> 01:06:25.856
Master Alus!


01:06:30.236 --> 01:06:33.489
I'm so glad you are both safe and sound.


01:06:34.198 --> 01:06:37.535
Truly,
this is the happiest day of my life.


01:06:43.082 --> 01:06:47.169
There's no need to cry, Sancho.
Hang on, did you always look so old?


01:06:47.712 --> 01:06:52.383
Well, it's been eight years
since you were turned to stone.


01:06:52.466 --> 01:06:53.634
Eight years?


01:06:54.510 --> 01:06:56.220
It's really been that long?


01:07:21.787 --> 01:07:23.581
They've grown in number.


01:07:24.040 --> 01:07:25.416
Let me look.


01:07:27.001 --> 01:07:29.253
Whoa! There are too many to count!


01:07:30.087 --> 01:07:34.759
So, Grandma and Mom
are somewhere on those islands?


01:07:35.134 --> 01:07:39.764
Right, but getting up there
will be anything but easy.


01:07:41.182 --> 01:07:43.476
Hopefully, we can find the Zenith Dragon.


01:07:48.689 --> 01:07:50.316
I'll be right there.


01:07:51.734 --> 01:07:53.402
Honestly...


01:07:55.696 --> 01:07:57.573
-Um...
-Ah.


01:07:57.656 --> 01:08:01.702
You're... That's right. I remember you!


01:08:02.620 --> 01:08:04.205
The smelly lad!


01:08:05.915 --> 01:08:08.626
I've always said it pays to help people,


01:08:08.709 --> 01:08:13.297
though I never dreamt
you'd bring me the Zenithian hero.


01:08:13.380 --> 01:08:17.510
Dr. Agon, Ladja has my mother
and wife held captive,


01:08:18.051 --> 01:08:21.180
so you and I
are both after the same thing.


01:08:22.014 --> 01:08:25.810
Yes, I too wish to put an end
to these darkest of times.


01:08:26.310 --> 01:08:30.648
I've heard the Zenith Dragon
lives in this town disguised as a human.


01:08:30.731 --> 01:08:31.941
Know anything?


01:08:38.781 --> 01:08:40.866
Is that a trick question?


01:08:41.408 --> 01:08:42.283
Um...


01:08:42.743 --> 01:08:43.618
Eh?


01:08:45.871 --> 01:08:47.288
Really?


01:08:47.372 --> 01:08:48.832
Dearie me.


01:08:52.044 --> 01:08:56.131
I never would have guessed
that Dr. Agon was the Zenith Dragon.


01:08:56.215 --> 01:08:57.466
Would you?


01:08:58.341 --> 01:09:00.511
I want to help, I do...


01:09:00.594 --> 01:09:01.804
Please!


01:09:01.886 --> 01:09:03.096
But I can't.


01:09:03.180 --> 01:09:04.055
What?


01:09:06.600 --> 01:09:09.812
I lost the dragon orb.


01:09:10.229 --> 01:09:12.148
I can't transform without it.


01:09:12.231 --> 01:09:14.399
What? Are you joking?


01:09:14.942 --> 01:09:18.194
How could you misplace
something so important?


01:09:18.487 --> 01:09:19.697
Where did you lose it?


01:09:19.779 --> 01:09:23.658
<i>Now that I'll never forget.
It was here, Uptaten Towers.</i>


01:09:23.742 --> 01:09:26.495
There? That's right by Roundbeck.


01:09:26.578 --> 01:09:29.540
Wait, do you mean...


01:09:30.249 --> 01:09:31.125
this?


01:09:31.207 --> 01:09:34.670
This is a piece of the dragon orb.


01:09:34.752 --> 01:09:37.423
I found it at Uptaten Towers as a boy,


01:09:37.840 --> 01:09:40.718
but Ladja destroyed it.


01:09:40.801 --> 01:09:42.178
Ah, hold on.


01:09:42.928 --> 01:09:44.220
This is a fake.


01:09:44.305 --> 01:09:45.514
Really?


01:09:45.598 --> 01:09:47.390
What does that mean for us?


01:09:52.354 --> 01:09:53.939
We're out of options.


01:09:55.482 --> 01:09:56.483
Okay.


01:09:57.193 --> 01:09:58.861
Time to ask the faeries.


01:09:59.486 --> 01:10:00.487
Faeries?


01:10:00.571 --> 01:10:04.074
They live in a cave found deep
in the mountains near Battenberg.


01:10:04.158 --> 01:10:06.327
It's said they can grant any wish.


01:10:06.410 --> 01:10:08.579
But meeting them is far from easy.


01:10:09.205 --> 01:10:11.457
They're protected by robots, you see.


01:10:11.540 --> 01:10:15.252
Robots? Isn't that a bit random?


01:10:15.336 --> 01:10:16.712
Don't ask me, friend.


01:10:16.795 --> 01:10:18.756
That's just how things are
this time round.


01:10:19.340 --> 01:10:20.591
This time round?


01:10:20.674 --> 01:10:23.469
And to make matters worse,


01:10:24.178 --> 01:10:28.224
the faeries acknowledge only those
who overcome a set of trials


01:10:29.058 --> 01:10:30.517
with their own strength.


01:10:37.233 --> 01:10:38.609
Gootrude.


01:10:38.692 --> 01:10:40.736
You followed me.


01:11:00.965 --> 01:11:02.299
Here they come.


01:11:23.404 --> 01:11:25.406
<i>How are we meant to get over there?</i>


01:11:25.739 --> 01:11:27.783
There has to be a way.


01:11:27.866 --> 01:11:29.076
Think!


01:11:31.036 --> 01:11:32.037
Gootrude...


01:11:32.788 --> 01:11:34.415
I could kiss you.


01:11:41.297 --> 01:11:43.882
If anyone can pull this off, it's us!


01:12:06.405 --> 01:12:07.948
Ouch.


01:12:09.533 --> 01:12:11.535
Huh? What? What now?


01:12:34.975 --> 01:12:36.477
Are you a faerie?


01:12:36.560 --> 01:12:37.770
No need to stand.


01:12:37.853 --> 01:12:41.482
My apologies
for putting you through such an ordeal.


01:12:41.899 --> 01:12:44.735
I shall not punish you
for bringing the slime.


01:12:46.904 --> 01:12:51.575
The mere fact you made it here
proves that you are righteous of heart.


01:12:52.409 --> 01:12:55.287
Allow me to grant you your wish.


01:12:55.788 --> 01:13:00.667
Please, seal the gates to Nadiria forever
and save my mother and wife.


01:13:01.085 --> 01:13:02.169
I cannot.


01:13:03.504 --> 01:13:07.132
However,
I will help you in your endeavors,


01:13:07.591 --> 01:13:10.719
but I cannot intervene directly.


01:13:10.803 --> 01:13:12.096
Then what should I...


01:13:12.971 --> 01:13:15.516
You seek this orb, correct?


01:13:15.599 --> 01:13:18.102
The dragon orb! Why do you have it?


01:13:18.185 --> 01:13:19.186
This is a fake.


01:13:20.729 --> 01:13:23.649
Allow me to send you back in time.


01:13:23.732 --> 01:13:26.110
Go and find your younger self.


01:13:26.485 --> 01:13:30.406
I think you know when and where.


01:13:30.906 --> 01:13:34.618
Say, that's a great orb you've got.
May I have a look?


01:13:35.661 --> 01:13:39.164
Wait, that was...


01:13:39.623 --> 01:13:41.458
Precisely.


01:13:41.959 --> 01:13:45.170
You know what must be done.


01:13:45.254 --> 01:13:47.756
You must return to the past.


01:13:47.840 --> 01:13:49.967
<i>So that's what happened.</i>


01:13:52.928 --> 01:13:55.764
Purrcy? Where are you?


01:13:55.848 --> 01:13:56.890
Hey, you there.


01:13:57.391 --> 01:13:59.935
Sorry, didn't mean to scare you.


01:14:00.018 --> 01:14:02.229
I'm a bit lost.


01:14:02.312 --> 01:14:03.605
Okay.


01:14:04.356 --> 01:14:05.274
Oh?


01:14:05.941 --> 01:14:08.444
Say, that's a great orb you've got.


01:14:08.527 --> 01:14:09.611
May I have a look?


01:14:09.695 --> 01:14:11.613
Huh? How'd you know?


01:14:15.033 --> 01:14:17.327
I can smell it from your bag.


01:14:17.411 --> 01:14:18.579
Oh, yeah?


01:14:19.288 --> 01:14:22.791
Sorry, but it's too important to show you.


01:14:22.875 --> 01:14:25.377
Whealbrook is that way. Bye.


01:14:25.461 --> 01:14:26.920
Hey, wait!


01:14:27.004 --> 01:14:30.174
I'm not trying to steal it, honest.


01:14:30.257 --> 01:14:31.884
Tell you what.


01:14:32.468 --> 01:14:37.055
I'll introduce you to my friend
if you'll show me your orb.


01:14:37.139 --> 01:14:40.350
You do know that makes you sound


01:14:40.434 --> 01:14:42.060
<i>even more suspicious?</i>


01:14:42.478 --> 01:14:44.813
Is that so?


01:14:44.897 --> 01:14:48.859
You might change your tune
after meeting my friend.


01:14:51.069 --> 01:14:53.822
Gootrude the Slime!


01:14:55.741 --> 01:14:58.368
It's just a slime?


01:14:59.244 --> 01:15:02.664
I've got a sabrecub friend, you know?


01:15:02.748 --> 01:15:03.999
He's called Purrcy.


01:15:04.082 --> 01:15:08.837
A sabrecub at your age? That's impressive.


01:15:09.254 --> 01:15:12.925
Not really. I just helped him out
and we became friends.


01:15:13.342 --> 01:15:15.427
Oh, and by the way,


01:15:16.053 --> 01:15:19.223
<i>think really hard before you get married.</i>


01:15:19.765 --> 01:15:24.019
Your true love
is someone you can tell anything to.


01:15:24.102 --> 01:15:25.562
Okay, got it.


01:15:25.646 --> 01:15:27.397
Wow, you're a good listener.


01:15:27.940 --> 01:15:32.653
Well, you don't seem like a bad person,
so I'll let you see the orb.


01:15:32.736 --> 01:15:33.737
Look at that!


01:15:35.531 --> 01:15:36.949
-Oops.
-Hey!


01:15:37.324 --> 01:15:38.951
Be careful!


01:15:39.034 --> 01:15:40.285
Sorry about that.


01:15:40.994 --> 01:15:41.870
Thanks.


01:15:42.579 --> 01:15:45.707
You're really lucky
to have a nice orb like that.


01:15:46.333 --> 01:15:49.086
Luca, we're leaving soon.


01:15:49.169 --> 01:15:50.295
Coming!


01:15:51.630 --> 01:15:53.048
I should go.


01:15:54.925 --> 01:15:55.926
What's wrong?


01:15:56.009 --> 01:15:57.261
Is that your dad?


01:15:57.344 --> 01:15:59.721
Yeah, he's really strong.


01:15:59.805 --> 01:16:01.306
You must really love him.


01:16:02.349 --> 01:16:03.809
I've got to go.


01:16:03.892 --> 01:16:06.770
Okay, thanks for showing me your treasure.


01:16:06.853 --> 01:16:07.813
No problem.


01:16:09.231 --> 01:16:10.274
Purrcy!


01:16:10.357 --> 01:16:11.942
-Hey.
-What?


01:16:12.401 --> 01:16:14.903
What would you do
if life was about to get tough?


01:16:15.320 --> 01:16:18.824
I might be little,
but I'm still Pankraz's son.


01:16:18.907 --> 01:16:21.660
Nothing scares me.


01:16:23.495 --> 01:16:25.831
Right. You're absolutely right!


01:16:26.623 --> 01:16:27.499
Bye!


01:16:30.252 --> 01:16:31.670
Wise beyond his years.


01:16:51.898 --> 01:16:53.400
Hold on tight.


01:17:09.374 --> 01:17:10.667
Wow.


01:17:11.835 --> 01:17:13.503
There she is!


01:17:24.723 --> 01:17:25.641
Bianca!


01:17:25.724 --> 01:17:26.975
Luca!


01:17:27.851 --> 01:17:29.144
Mom!


01:17:30.854 --> 01:17:31.980
You're...


01:17:32.064 --> 01:17:34.149
Are you Alus?


01:17:34.232 --> 01:17:35.150
That's me!


01:17:35.233 --> 01:17:37.152
You've grown so much.


01:17:38.278 --> 01:17:40.739
I'm sorry I wasn't there for you.


01:17:40.822 --> 01:17:42.074
Mommy!


01:17:44.242 --> 01:17:47.204
We've missed the cutest years of his life.


01:17:47.663 --> 01:17:49.915
There's plenty of time to make up for it.


01:17:49.998 --> 01:17:52.668
Bianca, what happened to your eyes?


01:17:53.168 --> 01:17:55.671
It turns out I also have Zenithian blood.


01:17:56.171 --> 01:17:59.091
You do? Well, that explains a lot!


01:18:01.885 --> 01:18:03.929
Your mother is up there.


01:18:19.945 --> 01:18:20.904
<i>Luca...</i>


01:18:21.279 --> 01:18:25.367
<i>Luca, this is your mother.</i>


01:18:25.450 --> 01:18:26.284
Huh?


01:18:26.368 --> 01:18:27.577
-Mom?
-Oh.


01:18:29.579 --> 01:18:32.874
<i>Luca, you should not have come.</i>


01:18:33.583 --> 01:18:35.627
I wanted to save you, Mom.


01:18:35.711 --> 01:18:38.422
<i>Your kindness alone is enough.</i>


01:18:38.505 --> 01:18:41.883
<i>You must forget about Ladja and the gates.</i>


01:18:42.801 --> 01:18:44.636
<i>Turn back and leave!</i>


01:18:44.720 --> 01:18:45.804
But...


01:18:45.929 --> 01:18:50.016
<i>This time round, Nimzo has amassed
even greater power than before.</i>


01:18:50.517 --> 01:18:54.104
<i>He could wipe out the world
if he so wished.</i>


01:18:54.187 --> 01:18:56.189
<i>Do not try to fight him.</i>


01:18:56.815 --> 01:18:57.983
This time round?


01:18:58.066 --> 01:19:01.403
<i>Yes, he is nothing like he used to be.</i>


01:19:02.112 --> 01:19:04.698
<i>We stand no chance against him.</i>


01:19:05.157 --> 01:19:09.494
<i>The gates will only open
if I cast the spell.</i>


01:19:10.245 --> 01:19:13.915
<i>I am the only one
who can keep the world safe.</i>


01:19:16.585 --> 01:19:17.836
Mom!


01:19:20.797 --> 01:19:22.507
Zenith Dragon!


01:19:22.591 --> 01:19:25.385
I am no longer the Ladja of old.


01:19:26.678 --> 01:19:28.305
Such strength.


01:19:33.769 --> 01:19:35.896
Don't mind me. Just go!


01:19:35.979 --> 01:19:37.439
Thank you, Dr. Agon!


01:19:43.737 --> 01:19:44.863
Ladja!


01:19:46.448 --> 01:19:47.491
Mom!


01:19:49.618 --> 01:19:50.577
Mom...


01:19:52.454 --> 01:19:53.455
Luca...


01:19:56.708 --> 01:20:00.545
I just wanted to see you one more time.


01:20:03.215 --> 01:20:06.968
It is the only thing
that has kept me going.


01:20:10.472 --> 01:20:11.765
At least...


01:20:14.267 --> 01:20:16.311
now the spell that opens the gates...


01:20:17.729 --> 01:20:21.066
will be forever lost.


01:20:24.694 --> 01:20:25.904
Mom...


01:20:29.241 --> 01:20:30.450
Ladja!


01:20:31.368 --> 01:20:33.286
You'll pay for this!


01:20:33.829 --> 01:20:35.997
Underlings! Destroy them!


01:20:43.088 --> 01:20:44.047
Oomph!


01:20:44.172 --> 01:20:45.632
Swoosh!


01:21:13.577 --> 01:21:14.911
Kazap!


01:21:27.549 --> 01:21:28.383
Thwack!


01:21:30.302 --> 01:21:31.136
Frizzle!


01:21:32.262 --> 01:21:33.305
Kasizzle!


01:21:38.768 --> 01:21:40.520
We're outnumbered.


01:21:45.150 --> 01:21:48.403
This has gone on long enough.


01:21:58.955 --> 01:22:00.081
What?


01:22:12.260 --> 01:22:14.387
I've come to repay my debt!


01:22:18.934 --> 01:22:20.727
Me too!


01:22:20.810 --> 01:22:22.187
Great timing!


01:22:22.270 --> 01:22:24.439
Charge!


01:22:45.168 --> 01:22:46.711
Luca, your mother!


01:22:50.215 --> 01:22:52.133
Leave the fodder to me!


01:22:52.217 --> 01:22:53.677
Thanks, Harry.


01:22:58.056 --> 01:22:59.599
We'll deal with this pest.


01:23:03.395 --> 01:23:05.230
We've got you now, Luca!


01:23:07.565 --> 01:23:09.275
Stop, Ladja!


01:23:09.693 --> 01:23:12.070
All alone, are you?


01:23:12.529 --> 01:23:15.657
Did you come all the way here just to die?


01:23:27.210 --> 01:23:28.253
Swoosh!


01:23:46.771 --> 01:23:48.356
You are not the Zenithian hero.


01:23:48.440 --> 01:23:50.859
What can you possibly hope to achieve?


01:23:52.986 --> 01:23:54.112
Kaswoosh!


01:24:20.680 --> 01:24:23.850
What a pity.


01:24:24.934 --> 01:24:28.396
You were oh-so close.


01:24:51.711 --> 01:24:52.837
Alus!


01:25:17.654 --> 01:25:19.614
This is...


01:25:20.406 --> 01:25:23.076
far from over.


01:25:26.788 --> 01:25:30.500
Mom sacrificed herself
to seal the gates for all eternity.


01:25:31.126 --> 01:25:33.044
Your plan is finished...


01:25:34.546 --> 01:25:35.880
and so are you!


01:25:38.133 --> 01:25:42.512
I am afraid you have underestimated me!


01:25:42.595 --> 01:25:46.391
The spell is lost forever!
You're out of options!


01:25:46.933 --> 01:25:49.394
The time is nigh.


01:25:50.353 --> 01:25:54.065
I gained this power from


01:25:54.190 --> 01:25:58.611
the light of Nadiria
that seeps forth from the gates.


01:26:03.867 --> 01:26:06.035
Grandmaster Nimzo.


01:26:06.119 --> 01:26:10.123
The time has finally come to set you free!


01:26:14.836 --> 01:26:20.592
Her power courses through me!


01:26:21.676 --> 01:26:25.972
And what magnificent power it is!


01:26:26.681 --> 01:26:31.728
<i>Opena il Nimzo!</i>


01:26:38.109 --> 01:26:39.736
And now...


01:26:40.695 --> 01:26:42.906
my greatest desire...


01:26:47.243 --> 01:26:49.579
will come to fruition.


01:27:01.007 --> 01:27:03.843
I'll shut them.


01:27:04.844 --> 01:27:07.055
If I throw this in, the gates will...


01:27:07.138 --> 01:27:07.972
But...


01:27:08.389 --> 01:27:10.308
how will you get up there?


01:27:13.770 --> 01:27:16.022
All aboard!


01:27:16.773 --> 01:27:20.902
This ship's about to set sail!


01:27:36.000 --> 01:27:37.418
Dad!


01:27:38.086 --> 01:27:40.546
Alus! You did it!


01:27:40.630 --> 01:27:43.091
Now the world's sa...


01:28:05.571 --> 01:28:07.699
What's happening?


01:28:09.993 --> 01:28:11.119
What's going on?


01:28:11.703 --> 01:28:13.204
What happened?


01:28:14.038 --> 01:28:15.081
Bianca.


01:28:15.164 --> 01:28:16.416
Hey, Bianca!


01:28:31.973 --> 01:28:33.641
Such craftsmanship.


01:28:34.559 --> 01:28:36.644
They really can make anything these days.


01:28:37.061 --> 01:28:39.147
What are you talking about?


01:28:39.647 --> 01:28:41.566
But, ultimately,
it's still just a program.


01:28:46.821 --> 01:28:50.074
<i>Let me show you
what this world really looks like.</i>


01:28:50.491 --> 01:28:51.784
Turn off texture mapping.


01:29:00.168 --> 01:29:01.544
What are you doing?


01:29:01.627 --> 01:29:03.212
Turn off gravity.


01:29:05.673 --> 01:29:06.507
Bianca!


01:29:06.591 --> 01:29:08.092
Turn off collision detection.


01:29:09.135 --> 01:29:10.219
Bianca.


01:29:10.887 --> 01:29:12.096
Bianca!


01:29:12.889 --> 01:29:15.058
Let's reduce the processor's load.


01:29:23.775 --> 01:29:24.776
Stop it!


01:29:25.651 --> 01:29:26.652
No!


01:29:29.280 --> 01:29:31.407
Leave us alone!


01:29:38.664 --> 01:29:41.626
Are you Nimzo?


01:29:42.085 --> 01:29:44.212
Technically speaking, no.


01:29:44.295 --> 01:29:50.093
I'm a virus that was hidden in the code
for Nimzo's character.


01:29:53.054 --> 01:29:56.182
It would seem that Mada noticed
something was a bit fishy.


01:29:56.265 --> 01:30:00.978
<i>Long ago, a game called Dragon Quest
took the world by storm.</i>


01:30:01.562 --> 01:30:03.481
A few decades later,


01:30:04.023 --> 01:30:07.402
this state-of-the-art VR technology
was perfected.


01:30:07.527 --> 01:30:09.362
Once commercialized,


01:30:09.904 --> 01:30:15.034
<i>that same Dragon Quest game
was remade for this new platform.</i>


01:30:15.535 --> 01:30:18.371
<i>And that is where you are now.</i>


01:30:20.248 --> 01:30:24.460
Drunk on nostalgia,
you decided to give the game a shot.


01:30:25.044 --> 01:30:28.923
Did you know
that it's only been a few hours


01:30:29.006 --> 01:30:31.759
since you started playing?


01:30:35.680 --> 01:30:38.558
Why are you doing this?


01:30:39.308 --> 01:30:41.436
Why won't you let us be?


01:30:41.519 --> 01:30:43.438
The person who created me


01:30:43.521 --> 01:30:48.693
reviles the scum
who call this virtual world home.


01:30:49.110 --> 01:30:52.321
So, they wrote me and loaded me in.


01:30:53.614 --> 01:30:55.741
That's it?


01:30:56.534 --> 01:30:58.411
What kind of motive is that?


01:30:58.494 --> 01:31:00.121
That's just the way it is.


01:31:00.204 --> 01:31:03.958
I'm merely the result
of a genius programmer's boredom.


01:31:04.375 --> 01:31:07.670
Oh, right, he gave me a message for you.


01:31:08.337 --> 01:31:11.382
He says "grow up, loser."


01:31:12.842 --> 01:31:14.218
Grow up?


01:31:14.719 --> 01:31:17.430
It's time you returned to the real world.


01:31:24.061 --> 01:31:28.357
Your memory will be wiped temporarily
while you're in here,


01:31:28.441 --> 01:31:31.319
so you can experience
life as the protagonist.


01:31:31.402 --> 01:31:35.198
I still can't believe I get
to go on a real adventure in this world.


01:31:36.032 --> 01:31:39.035
Didn't you always feel torn
between Bianca and Nera?


01:31:39.410 --> 01:31:42.955
I'm going to choose Nera this time,
since I always go for Bianca.


01:31:43.039 --> 01:31:46.042
This system
won't make that choice any easier.


01:31:46.125 --> 01:31:48.586
You'll be feeling exactly
what the protagonist does.


01:31:48.669 --> 01:31:53.299
I'll just have to convince myself!
Choose Nera, choose Nera!


01:31:53.382 --> 01:31:57.762
Ah, you just activated
the self-suggestion program.


01:31:57.845 --> 01:32:00.097
No kidding? That was quick.


01:32:02.099 --> 01:32:05.645
This system can create new programs
in the blink of an eye.


01:32:05.728 --> 01:32:06.812
Shall I turn it off?


01:32:06.896 --> 01:32:08.981
No, keep it on.


01:32:09.565 --> 01:32:12.235
Also, can I fight some robots?


01:32:12.318 --> 01:32:14.862
Certainly.
I'll add that for you right now.


01:32:15.321 --> 01:32:17.823
Go ahead and give yourself a name.


01:32:18.324 --> 01:32:19.325
Luca.


01:32:19.408 --> 01:32:21.327
I've always called my characters that.


01:32:21.410 --> 01:32:26.290
Right, I'm going to lower the goggles.
Can you read the text alright?


01:32:26.749 --> 01:32:27.583
Yep.


01:32:27.667 --> 01:32:29.877
Are you happy with these settings?


01:32:29.961 --> 01:32:30.920
Yes.


01:32:31.003 --> 01:32:34.173
Then it's time for you to venture forth.
Enjoy!


01:32:39.428 --> 01:32:40.596
Stop resisting!


01:32:44.475 --> 01:32:47.937
Why do you cling to this world?


01:32:48.020 --> 01:32:49.272
Neither you...


01:32:50.356 --> 01:32:53.651
nor your creator would understand.


01:32:54.110 --> 01:32:56.195
<i>Happy birthday.</i>


01:32:56.445 --> 01:32:59.073
<i>Dragon Quest V! Sweet!</i>


01:32:59.574 --> 01:33:01.867
<i>I've never once thought...</i>


01:33:03.703 --> 01:33:07.290
<i>of the worlds in these games as fake.</i>


01:33:08.874 --> 01:33:11.377
<i>Even if they're all just programs,</i>


01:33:12.086 --> 01:33:15.089
<i>the time I spent with them was real.</i>


01:33:15.923 --> 01:33:17.550
<i>And these journeys,</i>


01:33:18.092 --> 01:33:19.468
<i>these battles,</i>


01:33:19.844 --> 01:33:21.220
<i>everyone I met,</i>


01:33:23.055 --> 01:33:24.849
they'll always be here.


01:33:24.932 --> 01:33:26.809
They are hollow illusions.


01:33:26.892 --> 01:33:27.810
No!


01:33:28.644 --> 01:33:30.688
They're another reality!


01:33:31.355 --> 01:33:34.692
Shut up and die!


01:33:43.242 --> 01:33:44.076
Gootrude?


01:33:44.535 --> 01:33:45.953
Don't listen to him!


01:33:46.454 --> 01:33:47.913
Stay strong!


01:33:47.997 --> 01:33:49.040
Who are you?


01:33:49.123 --> 01:33:54.211
I'm the antivirus program
that keeps watch over this world!


01:33:55.713 --> 01:33:57.673
I've created a vaccine...


01:33:58.924 --> 01:34:01.052
and I'm entrusting it to you.


01:34:01.969 --> 01:34:05.389
You must complete your adventure!


01:34:12.688 --> 01:34:14.440
It's over!


01:34:42.218 --> 01:34:43.636
The world...


01:34:44.804 --> 01:34:46.055
it came back.


01:34:47.181 --> 01:34:49.475
Dad!


01:34:51.435 --> 01:34:52.561
Hey there.


01:34:54.105 --> 01:34:55.106
What happened?


01:34:55.606 --> 01:34:57.650
You all got put to sleep...


01:34:58.567 --> 01:35:00.528
but Nimzo is no more.


01:35:02.530 --> 01:35:05.282
I've never faced anyone so powerful.


01:35:06.325 --> 01:35:08.953
You really did it, Luca?


01:35:10.413 --> 01:35:12.873
Now we know who the real hero is!


01:35:15.835 --> 01:35:17.253
Listen up, soldiers!


01:35:18.212 --> 01:35:21.549
Our battle with Bishop Ladja has ended.


01:35:22.091 --> 01:35:24.719
We are victorious!


01:35:34.770 --> 01:35:37.314
Let me know if you ever need me.


01:35:37.398 --> 01:35:39.525
Until we meet again.


01:35:40.735 --> 01:35:44.447
Make sure you visit Coburg.
We'll be waiting for you!


01:35:44.530 --> 01:35:47.992
I will! I promise!


01:35:53.622 --> 01:35:56.250
Now that was an adventure.


01:35:56.333 --> 01:35:57.418
Dr. Agon!


01:35:57.918 --> 01:36:01.422
Nicely done, smelly lad!


01:36:07.887 --> 01:36:11.348
Look, there's Whealbrook!


01:36:11.432 --> 01:36:13.893
What a view this is!


01:36:16.562 --> 01:36:18.481
<i>When we reach my hometown,</i>


01:36:18.564 --> 01:36:20.733
<i>this adventure will come to an end</i>


01:36:21.650 --> 01:36:24.278
<i>and I'll return to the real world...</i>


01:36:26.614 --> 01:36:30.618
<i>but you'll always be real to me,
all of you.</i>


01:36:40.753 --> 01:36:41.670
Gootrude...


01:36:45.132 --> 01:36:47.968
Luca? Is something wrong?


01:36:48.385 --> 01:36:50.012
Come and join us!


01:36:50.095 --> 01:36:51.055
Dad!


01:36:52.807 --> 01:36:56.727
He's always got his head in the clouds.
Still, he's funny, though, eh?


01:36:58.062 --> 01:37:02.066
<i>This adventure will stay with me forever.</i>


01:37:02.149 --> 01:37:04.860
What are you grinning at?


01:37:04.944 --> 01:37:07.988
Just glad that I'm not alone, that's all.


01:37:08.113 --> 01:37:10.366
Huh? Of course you're not alone.


01:37:10.449 --> 01:37:11.992
You've got us,


01:37:12.076 --> 01:37:15.287
and we can watch Alus grow up together.


01:37:16.330 --> 01:37:17.331
Fireworks!


01:37:17.832 --> 01:37:20.209
I think they're welcoming us home!


01:37:20.292 --> 01:37:23.295
Come on, Luca, you saved the world.


01:37:23.379 --> 01:37:26.090
-So stand tall!
-Ouch!


01:37:26.173 --> 01:37:27.925
That hurt.


01:37:28.884 --> 01:37:31.929
-Wimp.
-No, it really hurt.


01:37:32.972 --> 01:37:38.018
-Then why are you smiling?
-I'm not kidding, you could've injured me!


01:37:40.145 --> 01:37:41.480
<i>This is as real as it gets.</i>


01:37:41.564 --> 01:37:42.731
<i>I...</i>


01:37:44.441 --> 01:37:45.943
<i>I was the hero.</i>

